<PortfolioPage title="Privacy | Shahid Zaka" description="Privacy information for this portfolio and blog.">
  <h1>Privacy</h1>
  <p>This personal portfolio and blog has no visitor accounts, comments, or contact forms.</p>

  <section class="portfolio-section">
    <h2>Hosting</h2>
    <p>GitHub Pages hosts this site. GitHub logs visitors’ IP addresses for security.
      <a href="https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement">GitHub Privacy Statement</a></p>
  </section>

  <section class="portfolio-section">
    <h2>Optional analytics</h2>
    <p>If you allow analytics, Google Analytics measures visits and page views. It may use cookies to distinguish visits. This site stores your analytics preference in your browser.</p>
    <p>You can change your choice under <strong>Analytics preferences</strong> in the footer when analytics is available. Declining stops future measurement from this site in that browser. You can clear existing analytics cookies through your browser settings.</p>
    <p><a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites">How Google uses information from sites that use its services</a></p>
  </section>
</PortfolioPage>
